## Confirmed model versions

- **Connector Alignment — v6**: generalized to both black and white
  connector colors. This is the "LATEST version" referenced throughout
  the deployment code; multicolor fine-tune pipeline lives in
  `training/` (not yet populated in this repo — see
  `docs/MISSING_FILES.md`).
- **Mic Wire Polarity — v1**: first-pass model, trained from
  `yolo11n.pt` (COCO-pretrained) rather than fine-tuned from the
  connector checkpoint, since the wire/terminal object has no shared
  visual foundation with the connector task. ~100 images per class
  (`defective`/`passing`) — lean for training from scratch, flagged as
  first-pass, not final. Training run name: `aoi_mic_wiring_v1`.

