## Dataset quirk — mic wiring

The Roboflow export for `aoi_mic_wiring_v1` (version 3) had no
`valid`/`test` folders at all (100% train, 0% held out) — a dataset
generation config issue, not a pipeline bug. Fixed by having the split
cell skip any split it can't find on disk, since later cells rebuild the
split from scratch anyway.

